{% set position = evidence.passage_position %}
{% if position.longer %}
<h3 id="document-passage-position">Longer-passage writing check</h3>
<p>{{ position.eligible }} eligible sentence centers across {{ position.paragraphs }} paragraphs and {{ position.sentence_count }} sentences.</p>
{% if position.status == 'flagged' %}
<p>The selected sentence showed a stronger AI-like writing response than its immediate neighbors. Review the wording in context.</p>
{% if position.text %}<p><strong>Selected sentence.</strong> {{ position.text }}</p>{% endif %}
<table class="multimedia-locator">
<thead><tr><th>Sentence</th><th>Original text characters</th><th>Raw response</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for row in position.rows %}
<tr><td>{{ row.label }}</td><td>[{{ row.source_start }}, {{ row.source_end }})</td><td>{{ '%.4g' | format(row.response) }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody>
</table>
{% elif position.status == 'unassessed' %}
<p>Complete responses were unavailable for the eligible centers.</p>
{% else %}
<p>No sentence was selected among the eligible centers. Authorship remains undetermined.</p>
{% endif %}
<p class="caption">This optional check carries zero weight in the overall assessment. JSON pointer <span class="mono">/coverage/passage_position_review</span>.</p>
{% else %}
<div{% if position.locator %} class="multimedia-scored-context"{% endif %}>
<h3 id="document-passage-position">Three-sentence writing check</h3>
{% if position.status == 'flagged' %}
<p>The middle sentence showed a stronger AI-like writing response than both neighbors. This check marked that sentence for inspection.</p>
{% elif position.status == 'unassessed' %}
<p>The input met the scope for this check. Complete responses were unavailable.</p>
{% else %}
<p>The middle sentence did not reach the review level for a stronger AI-like writing response than both neighbors. This result leaves authorship undetermined.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if position.text %}<p><strong>Middle sentence.</strong> {{ position.text }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if position.locator %}
<p class="caption">Original character positions in {% if position.locator.kind == 'docx' %}Word body paragraph {{ position.locator.paragraph_index + 1 }}{% else %}decoded email MIME part {{ position.locator.mime_part }}{% endif %}.</p>
{% endif %}
<table class="multimedia-locator">
<thead><tr><th>Sentence</th><th>Original text characters</th><th>Raw response</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for row in position.rows %}
<tr><td>{{ row.label }}</td><td>[{{ row.source_start }}, {{ row.source_end }})</td><td>{{ '%.4g' | format(row.response) if row.response is not none else 'Unavailable' }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody>
</table>
<p class="caption">Each response uses its sentence and immediate neighbors. This check carries zero weight in the overall assessment. JSON pointer <span class="mono">/coverage/passage_position_review</span>.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}
